WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.433
The mango tree

2
00:00:04.433 --> 00:00:11.333
The wind blows! Some mangoes fall from the tree. How many are left on the tree?

3
00:00:11.333 --> 00:00:14.000
There were seven mangoes.

4
00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:16.900
Three fell.

5
00:00:16.900 --> 00:00:19.900
Cross out the ones that fell.

6
00:00:19.900 --> 00:00:22.400
Four are left.

7
00:00:22.400 --> 00:00:25.967
Seven minus three equals four.
